{
  "title": "Quick Malaysian Carrot Stew",
  "description": "A fermented and tender Malaysian dish featuring carrots, wok-hei, and low-glycemic-friendly ingredients, cooked in a claypot. This energizing stew is perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
  "cuisine": "Malaysian",
